{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1351211-do-these-lyrics-remind-you-of-the-world-of-darkness","id":1351211,"title":"Do these lyrics remind you of the World of Darkness?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-26T20:26:19-08:00","id":1351211,"title":"Do these lyrics remind you of the World of Darkness?","content":"So you play your music<br /> And you smoke your pot<br /> And you f**k your boyfriend<br /> In the parking lot<br /> Ah but still you\u2019re aching<br /> For the things you haven\u2019t got<br /> What went wrong...<br /> <br /> This song always reminds me of the non-supernatural part of the WoD. An ordinary girl living a life of quiet desperation, dreaming about a handsome (or beautiful) Fiona coming to rescue her from her Banal existence...<br /> <br /> A charming Toreador works too, or even a magnetically attractive Fianna Galliard...<br /> <br /> The lyrics are gender specific, but they could easily apply to guys and non-binary people too.<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-26T22:05:25-08:00","id":1351224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1351211-do-these-lyrics-remind-you-of-the-world-of-darkness#post1351211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you play your music<br /> And you smoke your pot<br /> And you f**k your boyfriend<br /> In the parking lot<br /> Ah but still you\u2019re aching<br /> For the things you haven\u2019t got<br /> What went wrong...<br /> <br /> This song always reminds me of the non-supernatural part of the WoD. An ordinary girl living a life of quiet desperation, dreaming about a handsome (or beautiful) Fiona coming to rescue her from her Banal existence...<br /> <br /> A charming Toreador works too, or even a magnetically attractive Fianna Galliard...<br /> <br /> The lyrics are gender specific, but they could easily apply to guys and non-binary people too.<br /> <br /> What do you think?</div> </div> </div> </div>Feels like Thin-Blood/Caitiff lyrics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25611-gilbythefat","name":"GilbyTheFat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25611_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T01:38:08-08:00","id":1351243,"title":"","content":"Did someone cover Captain Jack and change the gender of the character?<br /> <br /> In any case, give the song is about a loser that's a rich white kid that's doing heroin to convince themselves they're cool and lacking in life despite having everything anyone could want, it could be a particularly wangsty Toreador or Venture... but really there's not need for that sad statement of a person to be more than a normal kid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T13:21:26-08:00","id":1351348,"title":"","content":"Heroin? I thought it was coke. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T13:23:47-08:00","id":1351351,"title":"","content":"I interpreted it as a song about someone who saw their life as shallow and meaningless and was searching for true love as a way out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T16:01:57-08:00","id":1351374,"title":"","content":"To quote Billy Joel, &quot;What's so horrible about an affluent young white teenager's life that he's got to shoot heroin? It's really a song about what I consider to be a pathetic loser kind of lifestyle. I've been accused of, 'Oh, this song promotes drug use and masturbation.' No, no, no. Listen to the song. This guy is a loser.&quot;<br /> <br /> The kid is doing drugs because he thinks his life is shallow and meaningless <b>rather</b> than trying something positive as a way out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name"